### Create a tracker
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trackers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Games" }

### Add media (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/1/media
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Celeste", "type": "GAME", "length": null, "priority": 2 }

### Same name again (409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/1/media
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Celeste", "type": "GAME" }

### Tracker doesn't exist (404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/999/media
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Hades", "type": "GAME" }

### Invalid type (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/1/media
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Hades", "type": "PODCAST" }